    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d189">

                <pb facs="0184" n="178" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg178"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-18"><hi rendition="#italic">April 18,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State presents his compliments to his excellency the British
                    ambassador, and has the honor to hand him herewith a list of the vessels which
                    are to compose the United States naval force in Bering Sea during the coining
                    season, which has been sent him by the Secretary of the Navy in compliance with
                    the request made him by Sir Julian Pauncefote.</p>


                <xi:include href="d189-a1.xml" xpointer="d189-a1"/>
